# IslandStatus: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_IslandStatus.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
shot status-open
note the last line: icons (cpu, thermometer, memory; a drawn battery first with a battery), "NN%" / "NN°", centred, dim colour; no words like "CPU"/"Memory"; status line centre at y ~49 (QML), island ~70 px tall with no activities
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
rec status-in 1.5 ptr glide 960 14 400
note the island opens in ~200 ms (QML) and the status line fades in and rises ~8 px over ~280 ms
ptr glide 925 49 200
wait 0.3
shot pop-none
note no resources popover yet (it opens at 500 ms)
wait 0.5
shot pop-cpu
note a popover hangs under the CPU figure (~14 px below), Processor row highlighted, graphs already filled
ptr glide 1000 49 200
wait 0.8
shot pop-mem
note the popover moved under memory; the Memory row highlighted
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1
shot status-closed
note popover and island gone
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
ipc island hot true
wait 1
shot status-hot
note the temperature figure is red (Material error / Glass light red)
ipc island hot false
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1

look glass
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
shot status-open
note the last line: icons (cpu, thermometer, memory; a drawn battery first with a battery), "NN%" / "NN°", centred, dim colour; no words like "CPU"/"Memory"; status line centre at y ~49 (QML), island ~70 px tall with no activities
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
rec status-in 1.5 ptr glide 960 14 400
note the island opens in ~200 ms (QML) and the status line fades in and rises ~8 px over ~280 ms
ptr glide 925 49 200
wait 0.3
shot pop-none
note no resources popover yet (it opens at 500 ms)
wait 0.5
shot pop-cpu
note a popover hangs under the CPU figure (~14 px below), Processor row highlighted, graphs already filled
ptr glide 1000 49 200
wait 0.8
shot pop-mem
note the popover moved under memory; the Memory row highlighted
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1
shot status-closed
note popover and island gone
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
ipc island hot true
wait 1
shot status-hot
note the temperature figure is red (Material error / Glass light red)
ipc island hot false
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1
